{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Holder of Place</i> is a roguelike auto-battler card game. Each run you are sent deeper into a strange and fading realm, where you alternate between intense combat encounters, strategic follower choices, and unpredictable event opportunities \u2014 all leading up to a final confrontation against the Dragon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you meet random casts of followers with unique traits, and must decide who to <i><strong>RECRUIT</strong></i> into your party. You <i><strong>ARRANGE</strong></i> them so that they open up different paths of synergies and strategies. You <strong><i>WATCH</i></strong> them fight waves after waves of increasingly difficult adversaries, beasts, past nemeses, and sometimes... even yourself.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732730/extras/aboutThisGame_break2.gif?t=1747738817\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732730/extras/aboutThisGame_break5.gif?t=1747738817\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wanderer, roam through dreadful dreams, ancient battlefield ruins, arcane cult enclaves, and beyond. Unearth darker secrets \u2014 about your past life and lost love in the kingdom, and the true origins of the Dragon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732730/extras/aboutThisGame_break4.png?t=1747738817\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast paced auto-battler gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the ruins of a dark science-fantasy world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a run from start to finish, with access to 70+ unique followers and trinkets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a taste of the ever-changing Reliquary Mode with curated modifiers</p>